('ww1','event','The First World War','A war across the globe.',1914,1918,false,'year',null,0,'europe',50,4,3,3,'story','Empires fight across Europe, the Middle East, Africa and the seas.','Mostly Europe.','Empires fall and the map is redrawn.','#7a635a','flag'),
