('india-independence','event','India and Pakistan Become Independent','The end of British rule.',1947,null,false,'year',null,0,'south-asia',28,77,3,3,'story','After decades of struggle, led in part by Gandhi''s non-violent movement, British India becomes two countries.','South Asia.','One-fifth of humanity gains self-rule; many other colonies follow.','#f7a8a0','flag'),
('dna','discovery','The Shape of DNA','The double helix.',1953,null,false,'year',null,0,'europe',52,0,3,3,'sprout','Watson, Crick, Franklin and Wilkins reveal how DNA is built.','Cambridge and London.','The instructions for life can now be read.','#8fae8b','dna'),
('sputnik','event','Sputnik','The first satellite.',1957,null,false,'year',null,0,'central-asia',46,63,3,1,'wonder','The Soviet Union launches a beeping metal sphere into orbit.','Kazakhstan.','The Space Age begins.','#b7a9d6','satellite'),
